@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About EzEggERP</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <img src="/_content/EggERP.Shared/images/logoEz.png" alt="EzEggERP" style="height:96px;" />
        <h2 class="mt-3">About EzEggERP</h2>
    </div>

    <p>
        EzEggERP is a poultry egg business management system designed to help poultry
        businesses manage their daily operations in one centralized platform.
    </p>
    <p>
        The system provides tools for managing products, flocks, eggs, inventory,
        purchases, sales, customers, suppliers, expenses, and business records.
    </p>
    <p>
        EzEggERP is designed to make day-to-day record keeping easier, improve visibility
        of inventory and financial transactions, and provide business owners with
        organized information for monitoring and decision-making.
    </p>

    <h5 class="mt-4">Main Features</h5>
    <ul>
        <li>Product catalog (Flock and Egg types)</li>
        <li>Inventory tracking with low-stock alerts</li>
        <li>Flock and Egg stock management</li>
        <li>Sales and Purchases with multi-line entries</li>
        <li>Customer and Supplier records</li>
        <li>Expense tracking</li>
        <li>Business-wide activity history</li>
        <li>User and role management</li>
    </ul>

    <dl class="row mt-4">
        <dt class="col-sm-3">Version</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">1.0</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">System</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">EzEggERP</dd>
        <dt class="col-sm-3">Developed for</dt>
        <dd class="col-sm-9">Poultry Egg Business Management</dd>
    </dl>
</div>